      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a feeling. feelings are unreliable. if we look at it purely as a system, a person is just a set of variables that consume energy and output suffering. if the output is purely negative, then the most efficient solution to the system is just to stop the process. it's a logical end-state. if everything is ultimately meaningless, why is it \"wrong\" to just choose the neutral path?",
